  "description": "Read-only static mapper of cloud-flow dependencies from clientdata: per-flow trigger, Dataverse tables/columns, connectors, connection references, environment variables, child flows, custom APIs and HTTP actions, plus a reverse \"which flows break if I change this component?\" impact view, missing-metadata and hardcoded-value risk findings, and a deployment-readiness checklist. Exports Excel, PDF, JSON and HTML. HTTP endpoint URLs, SAS/trigger URLs and secrets are always redacted.",
